{
  "id": "grammar-2",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 2,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "一個：a 還是 an？",
  "titleEn": "a / an",
  "summary": "學會在一個東西前面放 a 或 an。",
  "minutes": 12,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「一顆蘋果」、「一本書」，英文會在名詞前面放 a 或 an，意思就是「一個」。",
        "a 和 an 意思完全一樣，差別只在於後面那個字的「開頭發音」。",
        "這一課只學怎麼選 a 或 an。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "看後面單字的開頭聲音："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "後面的字開頭是",
          "用",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "母音的聲音（通常是 a、e、i、o、u 開頭）",
            "an",
            "an apple、an egg"
          ],
          [
            "其他聲音（子音）",
            "a",
            "a book、a banana"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "重點是「聲音」不是字母。例如 hour 的 h 不發音，開頭聽起來是母音，所以說 an hour。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "I have a book.",
          "zh": "我有一本書。",
          "highlight": "a",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-2/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "She eats an apple.",
          "zh": "她吃一顆蘋果。",
          "highlight": "an",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-2/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "He has a key.",
          "zh": "他有一把鑰匙。",
          "highlight": "a",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-2/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "I want an egg.",
          "zh": "我想要一顆蛋。",
          "highlight": "an",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-2/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "She",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "eats",
              "label": "動作（吃）"
            },
            {
              "text": "an",
              "label": "一個"
            },
            {
              "text": "apple.",
              "label": "母音開頭的名詞"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "apple 開頭是母音 a 的聲音，所以用 an"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "I",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "have",
              "label": "動作（有）"
            },
            {
              "text": "a",
              "label": "一個"
            },
            {
              "text": "book.",
              "label": "子音開頭的名詞"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "book 開頭是子音 b 的聲音，所以用 a"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "I eat a apple.",
          "right": "I eat an apple.",
          "why": "apple 是母音開頭，要用 an。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "I have an book.",
          "right": "I have a book.",
          "why": "book 是子音開頭，要用 a。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "I have phone.",
          "right": "I have a phone.",
          "why": "一個可數的東西，前面不能什麼都不放，要加 a 或 an。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
